1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 15]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,290
Remove the plaque!

4
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:24,450
My child,

5
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,450
how does it feel to hold power?

6
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,850
How does it feel to watch yourself

7
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:32,260
hurt the women you care about?

8
00:02:32,870 --> 00:02:34,620
The embroidery workshop you founded

9
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,570
fell from grace.

10
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:39,410
The fruit of your lifetime's hard work

11
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,540
became worthless,

12
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,980
stepped on by everyone.

13
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,820
Are you not disappointed in yourself?

14
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:52,940
If I were you,

15
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:57,130
I would be so disappointed in myself.

16
00:02:58,030 --> 00:02:58,690
Because you

17
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,540
used to believe so firmly

18
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,540
that if you could take over the Huo Clan,

19
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,060
you would lead it better than your aunts

20
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,890
ever did.

21
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:09,260
But the truth is,

22
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:11,820
you tried that in your previous life.

23
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,730
In the end,

24
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,610
you failed to save anyone.

25
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,660
You even became the person

26
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,540
you hated the most.

27
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,170
So you're saying

28
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:30,100
that even after I take over the Huo Clan,

29
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,380
I'll still make the same mistake.

30
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,980
I'll hurt my clan mates

31
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:41,260
like my aunts did

32
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:43,730
and lead

33
00:03:46,220 --> 00:03:47,310
my clan to doom.

34
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,050
That is the way it is.

35
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,940
You are stuck

36
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:56,130
in this cycle of tragedy.

37
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,730
And you

38
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:01,130
are too powerless to change it.

39
00:04:02,310 --> 00:04:03,500
If that is true,

40
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,260
then the blame should be on the world

41
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,850
and this destiny.

42
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,380
Enough talking.

43
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:14,890
If this world is flawed,

44
00:04:15,470 --> 00:04:16,540
I shall be the one to change it.

45
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,540
I

46
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,700
will not make the same mistake.

47
00:04:35,620 --> 00:04:39,060
[Staying True to Principles]

48
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:55,540
[Shushen Hall]

49
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:02,860
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Great Matron]

50
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,020
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Founding Matron]

51
00:05:06,390 --> 00:05:07,020
Miss Huo,

52
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:09,700
the elders are all dead.

53
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,810
According to the rules,

54
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,290
we have to appoint new members

55
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:13,460
for the sisters guild.

56
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:16,340
Tell everyone

57
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,460
that the Huo Sisters Guild is no more.

58
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:22,290
But...

59
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,220
Moving forward,

60
00:05:24,830 --> 00:05:25,730
our clan rules

61
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,140
will change.

62
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:32,700
Miss Huo,

63
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,220
our ancestors

64
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,460
established the sisters guild a century ago.

65
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,340
Everyone in the Mystic Nine knows that.

66
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:40,290
If you remove the guild now,

67
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,930
won't the Mystic Nine

68
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:45,020
make a fuss about it?

69
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:49,140
If the Mystic Nine chooses to follow the antiquated rules

70
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,220
instead of evolving with modern times,

71
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,540
then their comments

72
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,370
have no value to us.

73
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,100
Miss Huo,

74
00:05:58,510 --> 00:06:00,220
we will follow you no matter what.

75
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,020
With you here,

76
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,220
our clan will see a new dawn.

77
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:24,100
It's poisonous.

78
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,410
This herb

79
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,700
is like a narcotic fruit.

80
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,660
A bird will be stupefied

81
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,690
if it nibbles it.

82
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,340
We can use this to tame the beast.

83
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:51,700
It's not enough.

84
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,900
Gather more in other places.

85
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,050
What are you doing?

86
00:08:24,430 --> 00:08:25,290
I'm going in myself.

87
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,300
Since we're already here,

88
00:10:18,150 --> 00:10:19,530
let me show you a place.

89
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,010
Do you see that?

90
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:43,700
Do you know what that is?

91
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:47,490
We found mummified corpses here.

92
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,850
Do you know what they are?

93
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,890
Ascension.

94
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,130
Ascension?

95
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:03,010
We have cultivators

96
00:11:03,630 --> 00:11:05,250
who trained in solitude deep inside

97
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,220
a cave.

98
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:08,300
They want to attain divinity,

99
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,420
a transcendence of the soul.

100
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:13,530
These are their mortal shells after their ascension.

101
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:16,850
You won't understand anyway.

102
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:19,890
You're just making things up.

103
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,420
Let's continue.

104
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:46,820
What is that?

105
00:11:48,870 --> 00:11:51,460
[Resting Place of Loyal Souls]
Our fallen comrades.

106
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,940
Follow my hand

107
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,890
and look over there.

108
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:02,180
There is a bigger monster

109
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,980
inside the pond in front.

110
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,370
We lost

111
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:08,180
many men here.

112
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,010
You don't

113
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,220
look upset at all.

114
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:15,850
In fact, you're excited.

115
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,580
The greater the casualty,

116
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:19,250
the stronger

117
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,460
the monster is.

118
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,820
You're insane.

119
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,530
You just haven't seen its charm yet.

120
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:30,220
It is a league above

121
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:35,180
the one you're taming.

122
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:39,100
And it

123
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,650
will appear soon.

124
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:46,730
Wu Laogou.

125
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,300
Can you tame it?

126
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:53,420
Can you?

127
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:10,140
[Wu's Residence]

128
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:04,340
♪Folding time into paper kites that fly before my eyes♪

129
00:14:05,340 --> 00:14:10,500
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

130
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:15,860
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

131
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:21,860
♪I ask the water of Yique, who has moved into my heart?♪

132
00:14:22,300 --> 00:14:28,180
♪Pinching time with my fingertips, my longing for you keeps me awake♪

133
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:34,140
♪The smile as you look back is as bright as a flower♪

134
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:39,740
♪The story continues for millennia, and your beauty remains♪

135
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:47,180
♪In this turbulent life, you're always next to me♪

136
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:55,460
♪Don't wait until the flowers are in full bloom♪

137
00:14:56,020 --> 00:15:01,340
♪Don't let your misguided devotion squander away your youth♪

138
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:07,180
♪Even after a few cycles of time♪

139
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:13,460
♪I wish my heart still lights up the way we first met♪

140
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:19,300
♪Don't say the flowers tonight haven't lost their fragrance♪

141
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:25,180
♪Don't wait until your life becomes full of regrets♪

142
00:15:25,390 --> 00:15:27,420
I don't know where Laogou is.

143
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:32,130
Everyone left to look for him.

144
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,940
But I have a hunch

145
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:39,850
that he will be safe.

146
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,010
He will return.

147
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,130
You feel that too, don't you?

148
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:51,610
Staying here is safe.

149
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,850
If there's nothing left to eat,

150
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:56,580
just come to me.

151
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:57,770
Okay?

152
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:02,890
This is what you need.

153
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:14,900
It's wrong.

154
00:17:17,030 --> 00:17:17,660
Make another.

155
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:19,250
You!

156
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:45,770
I made this for you.

157
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:46,900
It's delicious.

158
00:17:47,590 --> 00:17:48,290
Enjoy.

159
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:36,140
Interesting herbs.

160
00:19:12,750 --> 00:19:13,730
My throat is itchy.

161
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:15,940
My chest is stuffy.

162
00:19:20,550 --> 00:19:21,770
My fingers are numb.

163
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:54,730
Tea claw vine?

164
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:05,980
I'm

165
00:21:07,030 --> 00:21:07,940
at Xiangxi.

166
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:17,580
[Xiangxi]

167
00:21:23,030 --> 00:21:23,860
Master Zhang,

168
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:25,530
do you think Fifth Master is suffering?

169
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:27,490
He has a rough childhood.

170
00:21:28,270 --> 00:21:29,090
So don't worry about him.

171
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,330
I was kidnapped once.

172
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,050
And every day,

173
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,250
I wondered if I could get out alive,

174
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,770
or if somebody

175
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,810
could cave me.

176
00:21:36,350 --> 00:21:38,010
That's different from being tortured.

177
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:40,050
Unlike you, Fifth Master won't just sit around

178
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:41,660
and let others torture him.

179
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:42,660
Master Zhang,

180
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:43,770
you're handing out

181
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:44,700
a lot of compliments now.

182
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,980
He's gone. Stop jinxing it.

183
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,380
Stupid Yu.

184
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:51,530
That's not what you should be saying now.

185
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:53,660
Fifth Master is missing,

186
00:21:53,830 --> 00:21:54,770
not gone.

187
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:56,810
I do worry about him.

188
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,860
But if we don't keep ourselves safe,

189
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,380
we'll die before he does.

190
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,090
Master Zhang,

191
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,530
where are we going?

192
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,810
To the 82 Stockade

193
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,180
and talk to their leader.

194
00:22:09,860 --> 00:22:14,260
[Heimao Stockade, Xiangxi]

195
00:22:17,780 --> 00:22:19,860
[Heimao Stockade]

196
00:22:21,830 --> 00:22:22,420
Who are you?

197
00:22:23,030 --> 00:22:24,860
Zhang Qishan, Changsha Defense Commander.

198
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:27,810
I'm here to see the leader of 82 Stockade.

199
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:28,940
Wait here.

200
00:22:31,550 --> 00:22:33,940
I didn't know your influence extends

201
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,250
to a remote place like this.

202
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:36,460
Impressive.

203
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:37,810
The last few years

204
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:39,490
have been tumultuous.

205
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:41,770
The Ministry of War wants me to build a rapport with 82 Stockade.

206
00:22:42,550 --> 00:22:43,250
But it's best

207
00:22:43,960 --> 00:22:45,050
to avoid them as much as possible.

208
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:46,460
Why?

209
00:22:54,310 --> 00:22:55,570
Chief is old.

210
00:22:55,790 --> 00:22:57,050
He only allows you to enter alone.

211
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,700
Wait for me here.

212
00:23:09,570 --> 00:23:12,330
What an attitude from an old chief.

213
00:23:12,830 --> 00:23:13,530
I heard

214
00:23:14,070 --> 00:23:15,980
when they assimilated tribal leaders in the Yongzheng era,

215
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:18,140
he was already the head of 82 Stockade.

216
00:23:18,310 --> 00:23:19,220
Assimilation of tribal leaders?

217
00:23:20,590 --> 00:23:21,940
Then he's over 100 years old.

218
00:23:22,550 --> 00:23:24,420
Can someone live that long?

219
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:25,460
Of course.

220
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:28,900
I know several others.

221
00:24:27,980 --> 00:24:31,780
[Chief of Heimao Stockade]

222
00:24:57,510 --> 00:24:59,220
After so many years, your room still hasn't changed at all.

223
00:25:00,270 --> 00:25:00,940
But you

224
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:02,420
have aged a lot.

225
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:06,460
Vicious words.

226
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:10,900
I almost thought you were the Underworld King who wants to take my life.

227
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:16,330
You're just as young.

228
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:19,250
Your time is not up yet.

229
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:21,860
You may only die after you answer

230
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,010
my questions.

231
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:26,090
I knew it.

232
00:25:26,590 --> 00:25:29,090
You're not here for a visit.

233
00:25:30,550 --> 00:25:31,730
Just

234
00:25:32,750 --> 00:25:34,090
cut to the chase.

235
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:35,180
One.

236
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,090
Did the Japanese

237
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:38,980
come to Xiangxi?

238
00:25:39,310 --> 00:25:39,770
Two.

239
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,490
The Otherworld Patriarch

240
00:25:42,070 --> 00:25:43,460
cultivated in a cave here in Xiangxi.

241
00:25:44,310 --> 00:25:45,250
Do you know

242
00:25:45,750 --> 00:25:46,490
which cave it is?

243
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:47,730
Three.

244
00:25:48,310 --> 00:25:49,620
Is there a place in Xiangxi

245
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:52,140
only accessible through underground rivers?

246
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:54,250
A place you can't reach on foot.

247
00:25:58,270 --> 00:25:59,050
One.

248
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:01,420
The Japanese

249
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:04,860
are deep inside Mount Heimen.

250
00:26:05,750 --> 00:26:07,940
That is a sacred mountain.

251
00:26:08,590 --> 00:26:10,730
You can only enter it on foot.

252
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:12,380
Two.

253
00:26:13,110 --> 00:26:14,620
The cave you're looking for

254
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,730
is in the mountain.

255
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,900
Three.

256
00:26:20,830 --> 00:26:22,140
No such place

257
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:24,900
outside the mountain.

258
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:27,140
But perhaps in the mountain.

259
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:31,770
I do not know the answer

260
00:26:33,110 --> 00:26:33,980
because

261
00:26:34,790 --> 00:26:36,220
no one has ever returned alive

262
00:26:37,310 --> 00:26:41,220
from the mountain.

263
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,220
But the Japanese went in.

264
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:48,290
Where is Mount Heimen?

265
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,050
Tell me how I can get there.

266
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:52,140
I don't know how the Japanese

267
00:26:52,830 --> 00:26:53,770
went in.

268
00:26:55,070 --> 00:26:56,810
But you won't be able to enter

269
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,980
because

270
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:03,620
a mountain deity lives there.

271
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,330
Unless...

272
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:26,860
Unless

273
00:27:29,310 --> 00:27:31,290
you bring a baby with you.

274
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:33,940
He can lead you away from the mountain deity.

275
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,860
Babies are often the most perceptive.

276
00:27:36,070 --> 00:27:38,220
They can sense the mountain deity.

277
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:39,530
If not,

278
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:42,490
all of you will be in grave danger.

279
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:47,940
What exactly is the mountain deity?

280
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:56,940
We have never seen it.

281
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:59,090
Our ancestors have made a pact

282
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:00,420
with it.

283
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:02,050
Every year,

284
00:28:03,960 --> 00:28:08,700
we'll offer livestock to it.

285
00:28:09,110 --> 00:28:11,330
It will protect the stockade.

286
00:28:11,750 --> 00:28:12,700
If not,

287
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:16,810
we'll suffer great misfortune.

288
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:23,140
The Qing Dynasty discontinued this ritual,

289
00:28:23,830 --> 00:28:26,180
so we stopped doing that.

290
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,220
That was when we stopped

291
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:31,010
seeing people

292
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:34,490
returning alive from the mountain.

293
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:39,220
If you promise to help me give offerings to the mountain deity,

294
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:42,620
I'll ask my men to bring a baby with you

295
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:44,900
to the mountain.

296
00:28:46,550 --> 00:28:47,090
You have a deal.

297
00:28:49,550 --> 00:28:50,660
The Japanese

298
00:28:52,070 --> 00:28:53,490
disregarded our rules.

299
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:55,250
My foster son

300
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:59,730
will enter the mountain with you together with his men

301
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:02,460
to kill them.

302
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:05,570
Make sure to protect the baby.

303
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:09,090
He is the key to your survival.

304
00:29:14,070 --> 00:29:16,010
I too wish to enter the mountain with you.

305
00:29:17,030 --> 00:29:17,730
If only

306
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,050
I were younger

307
00:29:21,750 --> 00:29:23,730
and could live longer.

308
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:25,380
Living longer

309
00:29:27,830 --> 00:29:30,460
is not necessarily a good thing.

310
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,770
I've known you for years.

311
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:38,090
I don't know what you're keeping here.

312
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,980
But look at your current state.

313
00:29:41,590 --> 00:29:42,530
If you want to live longer,

314
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:44,810
stop keeping it.

315
00:30:16,510 --> 00:30:17,380
We made a new one.

316
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:51,530
It works.

317
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:53,460
It works?

318
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:58,940
Great.

319
00:31:36,310 --> 00:31:37,660
Do you always come here to watch plays?

320
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,140
No.

321
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,180
If I had time,

322
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,900
I would sneak out.

323
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:45,220
I understand.

324
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,530
Another one of those prestigious family rules.

325
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:51,460
Do you think I'm that obedient?

326
00:31:51,680 --> 00:31:52,490
Of course, not.

327
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:54,660
That's why

328
00:31:56,310 --> 00:31:57,570
I think we're alike.

329
00:32:03,070 --> 00:32:04,290
The play is over.

330
00:32:05,350 --> 00:32:06,250
Are you not going back?

331
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:09,250
I love it

332
00:32:09,680 --> 00:32:10,860
when the play ends.

333
00:32:13,590 --> 00:32:14,220
How come?

334
00:32:16,510 --> 00:32:18,180
Iridescent clouds dissipate quickly. Colored glass is fragile.

335
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:20,490
It seems like everything in this world

336
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:24,050
is destined to meet a tragic end.

337
00:32:27,110 --> 00:32:28,250
It's a wonderful night,

338
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:29,860
and it will end soon.

339
00:32:30,590 --> 00:32:31,490
I should get used to this feeling

340
00:32:31,750 --> 00:32:32,660
as soon as possible.

341
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:36,730
I beg to differ.

342
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,810
If the play is mesmerizing enough,

343
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:43,530
in my heart,

344
00:32:45,270 --> 00:32:46,220
it will never end.

345
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:52,220
So things I hold dear

346
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:54,290
will never meet a tragic end.

347
00:33:02,240 --> 00:33:02,900
Perhaps.

348
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:06,420
Look.

349
00:33:07,270 --> 00:33:09,330
The Big Dipper is so bright tonight.

350
00:33:12,110 --> 00:33:12,810
May

351
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:17,290
it remain like this forever.

352
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:20,290
It is beautiful.

353
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,010
Growing up, I've seen

354
00:33:23,030 --> 00:33:24,140
many wondrous trinkets.

355
00:33:25,750 --> 00:33:27,290
But none of them holds a candle

356
00:33:28,070 --> 00:33:29,530
to the Big Dipper.

357
00:33:39,440 --> 00:33:40,620
Until the day I met you.

358
00:33:41,510 --> 00:33:43,050
When you came to defend me, you were more beautiful

359
00:33:44,750 --> 00:33:45,570
than the stars.

360
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,330
The stars are so far away from me.

361
00:33:54,350 --> 00:33:55,460
I wonder if she

362
00:33:56,550 --> 00:33:57,460
will notice me.

363
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:08,610
Wherever you are,

364
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:15,610
she will always notice you.

365
00:34:41,230 --> 00:34:42,820
Laogou, run.

366
00:34:43,190 --> 00:34:44,050
Run!

367
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:55,300
This starry sky

368
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:59,210
will be ours soon.

369
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:01,050
Mr. Wu,

370
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,490
thank you for your assistance.

371
00:35:16,400 --> 00:35:16,940
No.

372
00:35:17,960 --> 00:35:18,490
I have to...

373
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:20,650
I have to escape this place.

374
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:07,980
Cui.

375
00:36:08,670 --> 00:36:09,530
Bring this out.

376
00:36:10,190 --> 00:36:10,860
Find Xiangu.

377
00:36:28,670 --> 00:36:30,260
Xiangu will find me.

378
00:36:31,670 --> 00:36:33,130
She will.

379
00:36:52,340 --> 00:36:55,780
[Huo's Residence]

380
00:36:58,780 --> 00:37:01,980
[Shushen Hall]

381
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:09,420
Congratulations, Miss Huo.

382
00:37:09,670 --> 00:37:11,490
You overcame your family feud

383
00:37:12,320 --> 00:37:14,010
and took over the clan for real.

384
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:23,780
I heard

385
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:25,380
that you

386
00:37:26,150 --> 00:37:27,460
do not like the Japanese.

387
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,780
Changsha forbids any Japanese from entering.

388
00:37:30,760 --> 00:37:32,090
How come you can enter here

389
00:37:32,710 --> 00:37:33,610
so freely?

390
00:37:34,170 --> 00:37:37,340
We have a special permit from the government.

391
00:37:37,710 --> 00:37:39,530
We can stay in Changsha for 12 hours.

392
00:37:41,880 --> 00:37:42,490
Take a look.

393
00:37:43,550 --> 00:37:45,650
This is the total amount the Japanese Chamber of Commerce

394
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,130
[Huo, Confidential]
invested in your clan.

395
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:48,420
It's an amount

396
00:37:49,550 --> 00:37:52,820
you're incapable of repaying.

397
00:37:56,670 --> 00:37:58,010
That said, we do not lack funding.

398
00:37:58,480 --> 00:37:59,420
We just want

399
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:01,260
to be friends with you.

400
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:08,050
I was told you contracted the black plague in the mine.

401
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:09,780
As a token of sincerity,

402
00:38:10,710 --> 00:38:12,980
I spent a fortune to purchase a batch of special medicine.

403
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:15,170
It will cure all of you.

404
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:18,460
What do you want?

405
00:38:20,070 --> 00:38:20,860
Miss Huo.

406
00:38:21,510 --> 00:38:23,740
If you continue working with us,

407
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,050
your clan

408
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:27,940
will be the leader of the Mystic Nine.

409
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,380
Becoming the leader of the Mystic Nine

410
00:38:31,380 --> 00:38:32,820
is not an advantage per se.

411
00:38:34,070 --> 00:38:35,170
It's not the only thing

412
00:38:36,030 --> 00:38:37,010
my clan wants.

413
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:40,860
How forthcoming of you.

414
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:42,530
Don't worry.

415
00:38:43,510 --> 00:38:45,460
We, the Japanese, are very generous.

416
00:38:45,960 --> 00:38:47,420
We can give you

417
00:38:48,550 --> 00:38:50,010
whatever you want.

418
00:38:54,630 --> 00:38:55,740
Partners?

419
00:39:36,980 --> 00:39:38,220
[Ma Jinbao]

420
00:39:39,180 --> 00:39:40,220
[Su Amei]

421
00:39:59,110 --> 00:39:59,530
Master,

422
00:40:01,190 --> 00:40:02,210
82 Stockade entrusted

423
00:40:02,230 --> 00:40:03,900
such an important ritual to us.

424
00:40:05,070 --> 00:40:06,490
Then, they sent their men to follow us.

425
00:40:07,230 --> 00:40:07,820
What are they trying to do?

426
00:40:09,030 --> 00:40:12,570
Whenever a group is sent into Mount Heimen,

427
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:15,300
only the leader comes out.

428
00:40:16,590 --> 00:40:17,610
So in this trip,

429
00:40:19,510 --> 00:40:20,650
we are the offerings?

430
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:24,740
They never want us to return alive.

431
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:26,690
Master Zhang.

432
00:40:27,590 --> 00:40:29,210
This place is an ill omen.

433
00:40:29,630 --> 00:40:31,010
You always say there is an ill omen.

434
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:32,460
Where is it?

435
00:40:35,230 --> 00:40:35,650
Master,

436
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:37,780
you're on good terms

437
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,690
with Stockade 82.

438
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:40,460
Are they really trying to get you killed?

439
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:43,090
Desperate times

440
00:40:44,070 --> 00:40:45,820
will often blind one's moral compass.

441
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,900
For the Chief, the citizens of Stockade 82

442
00:40:49,670 --> 00:40:51,740
are his responsibilities.

443
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:53,740
He will do anything,

444
00:40:54,670 --> 00:40:55,650
right or wrong,

445
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:56,530
to protect the citizens.

446
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:58,420
Naturally, our lives

447
00:40:59,280 --> 00:41:00,980
can be sacrificed.

448
00:41:06,500 --> 00:41:07,340
So they...

449
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:09,050
They don't trust us.

450
00:41:09,830 --> 00:41:11,490
They are here to help us

451
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:13,300
and to keep us in check.

452
00:41:13,630 --> 00:41:14,300
Keep us in check?

453
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:15,780
They really think they can?

454
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:18,530
Do not underestimate a man who will die soon.

455
00:41:20,070 --> 00:41:20,940
A man who will die soon?

456
00:41:23,510 --> 00:41:24,380
There is a rule.

457
00:41:25,630 --> 00:41:26,780
Everything in the mountain

458
00:41:27,190 --> 00:41:28,170
belongs to the mountain deity.

459
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:29,780
If they kill the Japanese,

460
00:41:30,590 --> 00:41:31,820
they will offend the mountain deity.

461
00:41:32,550 --> 00:41:34,690
So before they came, they took a pill.

462
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:37,780
A poisonous pill that will kill them after a week.

463
00:41:39,140 --> 00:41:40,920
This is their last mission

464
00:41:41,190 --> 00:41:42,090
before they die.

465
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:50,650
Master,

466
00:41:51,670 --> 00:41:53,630
what exactly is the mountain deity?

467
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,380
It is our prey.

468
00:41:58,110 --> 00:41:59,610
Just kill it

469
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:01,650
and the Japanese.

470
00:42:02,230 --> 00:42:02,650
Master Zhang.

471
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,340
As the saying goes,

472
00:42:04,760 --> 00:42:06,900
keep your friends close, and your enemies closer.

473
00:42:07,760 --> 00:42:09,010
Do not underestimate our foes.

474
00:42:10,030 --> 00:42:12,210
That thing has lived for centuries.

475
00:42:12,630 --> 00:42:13,380
I'm sure

476
00:42:13,670 --> 00:42:14,570
many bold hunters

477
00:42:14,590 --> 00:42:16,010
have tried to kill it.

478
00:42:16,280 --> 00:42:17,260
But they all failed.

479
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:18,460
That means

480
00:42:19,070 --> 00:42:21,650
it has withstood the trial of time.

481
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:24,820
And I hate those who live longer than they should.

482
00:42:26,590 --> 00:42:27,490
- Master Zhang. - Eighth Master.

483
00:42:28,030 --> 00:42:29,860
Have you seen anything more ruthless than us?

484
00:42:30,590 --> 00:42:32,050
- But you... - Eighth Master.

485
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:33,690
Keep the gun properly. You might misfire it.

486
00:42:35,150 --> 00:42:35,970
Sure.

487
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,210
Don't worry.

488
00:42:38,070 --> 00:42:38,780
Listen.

489
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,420
Before I left,

490
00:42:40,710 --> 00:42:41,570
I performed a divination.

491
00:42:42,110 --> 00:42:42,740
This trip

492
00:42:43,030 --> 00:42:45,050
will be safe. And I might

493
00:42:45,510 --> 00:42:46,300
get lucky with girls.

494
00:42:47,190 --> 00:42:48,380
Perhaps when we return to Heimao Stockade,

495
00:42:48,510 --> 00:42:50,260
a beauty will fall for me.

496
00:42:50,550 --> 00:42:53,340
And the Qi's bloodline shall continue...

497
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:55,860
Let me finish!

498
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:26,650
For you. Try it.

499
00:43:46,550 --> 00:43:47,820
That's a treasure, Master Zhang.

500
00:43:48,510 --> 00:43:50,260
You can only find this in Xiangxi.

501
00:43:50,920 --> 00:43:51,610
Quick.

502
00:43:52,070 --> 00:43:53,130
Share it with everyone.

503
00:43:53,630 --> 00:43:54,530
Let them try it.

504
00:44:02,710 --> 00:44:03,260
Thanks.

505
00:44:10,360 --> 00:44:10,820
Master Zhang.

506
00:44:11,510 --> 00:44:12,130
Is there

507
00:44:12,590 --> 00:44:13,570
a way

508
00:44:13,630 --> 00:44:14,820
to save these dying people?

509
00:44:16,590 --> 00:44:17,210
No.

510
00:44:18,630 --> 00:44:19,650
Xiangxi is a land of poison.

511
00:44:20,230 --> 00:44:21,380
Only the locals can make the antidotes.

512
00:44:22,320 --> 00:44:23,570
I cannot save those who wish for death.

513
00:44:38,670 --> 00:44:38,940
Thank you.

514
00:44:38,960 --> 00:44:39,570
I'll be frank with you.

515
00:44:40,880 --> 00:44:41,900
In this trip,

516
00:44:42,320 --> 00:44:43,740
we will kill the mountain deity.

517
00:44:45,510 --> 00:44:46,010
This is good.

518
00:44:49,710 --> 00:44:50,490
Kill

519
00:44:51,150 --> 00:44:51,980
the mountain deity?

520
00:44:56,880 --> 00:44:57,780
You'd better

521
00:44:59,920 --> 00:45:01,050
kill it thoroughly.

522
00:45:06,480 --> 00:45:07,340
You're not going to stop me?

523
00:45:11,760 --> 00:45:13,260
If the mountain deity can be killed,

524
00:45:13,960 --> 00:45:14,650
then it

525
00:45:15,110 --> 00:45:16,130
is not a deity at all.

526
00:45:17,280 --> 00:45:17,900
We

527
00:45:18,510 --> 00:45:19,380
won't be afraid of it.

528
00:45:20,840 --> 00:45:22,010
If it kills you,

529
00:45:22,880 --> 00:45:23,980
dying to it

530
00:45:24,760 --> 00:45:26,090
is the best way to die.

531
00:45:43,400 --> 00:45:44,130
So?

532
00:45:45,590 --> 00:45:46,780
Have you tamed it?

533
00:47:44,670 --> 00:47:46,300
I knew I got the right person.

534
00:47:54,000 --> 00:47:56,300
So much for the secret of the Otherworld Tower.

535
00:47:57,550 --> 00:47:58,690
If you had truly mastered its secret,

536
00:47:59,590 --> 00:48:01,260
you wouldn't have been so afraid of a beast.

537
00:48:01,630 --> 00:48:02,940
It is not a beast.

538
00:48:05,880 --> 00:48:07,260
Its name is Zhainiangniang.

539
00:48:08,320 --> 00:48:09,610
It was first recorded in the writings

540
00:48:09,670 --> 00:48:11,090
of Yin Changsheng.

541
00:48:12,070 --> 00:48:12,820
People

542
00:48:13,400 --> 00:48:15,130
also call it the mountain deity.

543
00:48:16,550 --> 00:48:18,650
You have no idea how beautiful

544
00:48:18,760 --> 00:48:21,460
and captivating creatures like it are.

545
00:48:25,360 --> 00:48:26,090
And now...

546
00:50:14,030 --> 00:50:15,300
If you blow that whistle,

547
00:50:15,840 --> 00:50:17,260
it will obey whatever command

548
00:50:17,400 --> 00:50:18,530
you give it?

549
00:50:19,230 --> 00:50:19,940
I think so.

550
00:50:21,280 --> 00:50:22,460
So, can you now go

551
00:50:23,360 --> 00:50:24,530
to the place you want to go?

552
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:26,130
Yes.

553
00:50:27,670 --> 00:50:28,820
Yes.

554
00:50:29,590 --> 00:50:31,090
I'll bring you over.

555
00:50:32,550 --> 00:50:33,690
You can also

556
00:50:36,320 --> 00:50:38,130
release it now.

557
00:50:58,700 --> 00:51:02,860
♪The past fades like smoke♪

558
00:51:03,220 --> 00:51:05,940
♪A choice is made in silence♪

559
00:51:06,220 --> 00:51:09,020
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

560
00:51:09,420 --> 00:51:13,180
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

561
00:51:13,420 --> 00:51:16,860
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

562
00:51:17,140 --> 00:51:20,540
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

563
00:51:20,620 --> 00:51:27,900
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

564
00:51:28,340 --> 00:51:31,620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

565
00:51:31,900 --> 00:51:35,140
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

566
00:51:35,300 --> 00:51:39,340
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

567
00:51:39,540 --> 00:51:42,900
♪Who believes in fate?♪

568
00:51:43,140 --> 00:51:46,500
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

569
00:51:46,740 --> 00:51:50,020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

570
00:51:50,340 --> 00:51:54,020
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

571
00:51:54,220 --> 00:51:57,460
♪Take care♪

572
00:51:57,460 --> 00:52:00,020
♪We once raced♪

573
00:52:00,100 --> 00:52:02,020
♪For the dawn♪

574
00:52:02,180 --> 00:52:05,460
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

575
00:52:05,580 --> 00:52:08,860
♪In the web of fate♪

576
00:52:08,860 --> 00:52:12,060
♪No one can escape♪

577
00:52:13,060 --> 00:52:14,900
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

578
00:52:15,060 --> 00:52:16,620
♪We too were young once♪

579
00:52:16,700 --> 00:52:20,140
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

580
00:52:20,340 --> 00:52:22,660
♪Keep the ember lit♪

581
00:52:22,780 --> 00:52:27,300
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

582
00:52:27,420 --> 00:52:30,380
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

583
00:52:30,620 --> 00:52:34,140
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

584
00:52:34,260 --> 00:52:38,020
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

585
00:52:38,340 --> 00:52:41,820
♪Who believes in fate?♪

586
00:52:41,980 --> 00:52:44,980
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

587
00:52:45,220 --> 00:52:48,980
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

588
00:52:49,140 --> 00:52:52,860
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

589
00:52:52,980 --> 00:53:04,420
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
